@startuml Deployment_View
title Smart E-Mobility Hub — Deployment View (Submission 3)
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

node "Student device" <<device>> as StudentDevice {
  node "Browser" <<executionEnvironment>> as StudentBrowser {
    artifact "Student Portal\n(UI + in-progress selection)" as StudentUI
  }
}

node "Operator device" <<device>> as OperatorDevice {
  node "Browser" <<executionEnvironment>> as OperatorBrowser {
    artifact "Operator Portal\n(UI + in-progress selection)" as OperatorUI
  }
}

node "Application host" <<device>> as ApplicationHost {
  node "One Web/API process" <<executionEnvironment>> as Process {
    artifact "API handlers\nSession and source checks" as API
    artifact "Fleet & Incident module\nFleetService / IncidentService\nTelemetryAdapter / health scheduler" as Fleet
    artifact "Parking & Private EV module" as Parking
    artifact "Other four domain modules\nHub / Rental / Charging / Simulation" as Domain
    artifact "Authoritative in-memory state\nShared lock + staged Unit of Work\nCommand/event results + audit" as State
  }
  artifact "JSON seed fixtures" as Fixtures
}

node "Telemetry simulator host" <<device>> as SimulatorHost {
  artifact "Timestamped mock event producer\nVehicle / parking / charging point" as Producer
}

StudentBrowser --> API : HTTPS / Student requests
OperatorBrowser --> API : HTTPS / Operator requests
Producer --> API : HTTPS / authenticated telemetry
Fixtures --> State : initialize on startup
API -[hidden]-> Fleet
Fleet -[hidden]-> Parking
Parking -[hidden]-> Domain
Domain -[hidden]-> State

legend bottom
  Artifacts inside the Web/API process use in-process calls and the same state lock.
  Browser state holds UI selections; resource commitments are decided by the application.
  No production database or physical IoT gateway is required for this MVP design.
  State and deduplication results last for the process lifetime; restart reloads fixtures.
  The simulator and application may share one laptop during demonstration.
endlegend
@enduml
